OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry told previous surgery
OL,4,Adeath of baby's brother was a 'red
OL,5,Aflag'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death of a sibling was a "red flag"
OL,8,Fbefore surgery was later carried out on
OL,9,Fhis baby brother, an inquiry has heard.
OL,11,FMichael Wilson was born on 11 August
OL,12,F2021 at Aberdeen Maternity Hospital,
OL,13,Fbut died two months later at the Royal
OL,14,FAberdeen Children's Hospital on 15
OL,15,FOctober 2021.
OL,17,FHis brother had an inherited heart
OL,18,Fcondition and had previously died from
OL,19,Fcomplications after cardiac surgery in
OL,20,FGlasgow in 2019.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
