OL,3,GNEWSAInquiry told previous surgery
OL,4,Adeath of baby's brother was a 'red
OL,5,Aflag'
OL,6,
OL,7,FFamily GP Fraser Sutherland, who had
OL,8,Freferred Michael for treatment, told
OL,9,Fthe third day of a fatal accident
OL,10,Finquiry (FAI) he thought the earlier
OL,11,Fdeath was a "warning sign".
